### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create Pluggy Connect Token
POST http://localhost:3000/connect/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123"
}

### Link Pluggy Item to User (after Connect widget success)
POST http://localhost:3000/connect/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "item_id": "item-id-from-pluggy"
}

### Register Pluggy Webhooks (requires WEBHOOK_BASE_URL)
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/pluggy/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": ["transactions/created", "item/created", "item/updated"]
}

### List Payments
GET http://localhost:3000/payments?user_id=user-123&status=pending&limit=20

### Ingest Android Notification Payment
POST http://localhost:3000/payments/from-notification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "external_id": "notif-fingerprint-abc",
  "amount": "45.90",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "description": "Compra no débito",
  "merchant": "Mercado Extra",
  "paid_at": "2026-09-02T13:30:00Z",
  "raw_payload": {
    "package": "com.nu.production",
    "title": "Compra aprovada"
  }
}
